{"sections":[{"slug":"Calabi--丘流形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Calabi--丘流形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Calabi–<span lang=\"zh\">丘流形</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Calabi–丘流形”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>Calabi–<span lang=\"zh\">丘流形是</span> Ricci <span lang=\"zh\">平坦的紧</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kähler流形","text":"Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/典范丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">典范丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">平凡</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">第一</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">消失</span>.</p>\n<p>Calabi–<span lang=\"zh\">丘流形可视为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/K3曲面","text":"K3 <span lang=\"zh\">曲面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>.</p>\n<p>Calabi–<span lang=\"zh\">丘流形的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/和乐","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">和乐</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">属于</span> $SU(n)$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">代数簇</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的光滑射影代数簇</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/典范层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">典范丛</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathscr K_X\\simeq \\mathscr O_X$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称其为</span> <strong>Calabi–<span lang=\"zh\">丘</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}